Lord Lord, good

    Thanks to the lords for their support of The Legend of the Lord. In this hot July, the game will be updated to v0.2.33.0. The update is as follows:
    1. Add thousands of river races, including a total of 22 new cards;
    2. Add a copy of the Thousand River Hunting Festival;
    3, new out of the box feedback, the cumulative number of out of the box can get additional rewards;
    4, the black market added thousands of river avatars, avatar boxes, banner goods;
    5, repair 2V1 battlefield BUG;
    6. Optimize the tournament process to make the game rhythm faster;
    7. Add account binding mobile phone and recall password function;
    8. Repair some other bugs;
    9, card effect adjustment:
       1) Vientiane Wars can be interrupted
       2) Resentment curse each unit causes damage reduced to 2 points

   thank you all

